A '''temple''' of [[the Force]] was located on<ref name="The Relic Raiders" /> the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]<ref name="Appendix">{{GalaxyMapAppendix}} &mdash; Based on corresponding data for the [[Tehar system]]</ref> [[planet]] [[Tehar]].<ref name="Ace Squadron" /> While at a [[Ashas Ree Temple of the Force|Temple of the Force]] on the planet [[Ashas Ree]]<ref name="The Relic Raiders" /> in [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{ResistanceDate|2|7}}</ref> the [[Kel and Eila's family|siblings]]<ref name="Eila">{{Databank|eila|Eila}}</ref> [[Kel]] and [[Eila]],<ref name="The Relic Raiders" /> [[Homeworld|natives]] of Tehar,<ref name="Ace Squadron" /> spoke about the temple. Eila stated that the Ashas Ree temple reminded<ref name="The Relic Raiders" /> her<ref name="Eila" /> of the temple, which Kel agreed with and noted that the one on Ashas Ree was larger than their temple.<ref name="The Relic Raiders" />

==Behind the scenes==
The temple was originally to be mentioned in "[[The New Trooper]],"<ref name="Bucket's List">{{SW|url=news/buckets-list-extra-the-new-trooper-star-wars-resistance|text=Bucket's List Extra: 6 Fun Facts from "The New Trooper" - ''Star Wars Resistance''}}</ref> the sixteenth episode of the [[Star Wars Resistance Season One|first season]] of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'',<ref name="Insider">{{InsiderCite|190|Resistance Revisited|''Resistance'' Revisited}}</ref> which aired on [[February 10]], [[2019]].<ref name="Disney Press">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref> The episode would have established that healers at the temple practiced the [[meditation]] technique known as "[[mudra-jee]]." The mention of the temple was ultimately removed from the episode, but was included in the article "Bucket's List Extra: 6 Fun Facts from 'The New Trooper' &ndash; ''Star Wars Resistance''," which was posted on [[StarWars.com]] on [[February 11]], 2019.<ref name="Bucket's List" />

